00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:06.150 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  i was a high school teacher  for 19 years and then i became a  principal of an elementary school and  for the past two years i've been a  superintendent i want to get students  active and engaged and co-create their  learning experience with their teachers  and you can only do that when you have  the proper tools and skills i'm also  doing another certification with another  university and they had a module on  design thinking and i said okay this i  can bring to my board and i got really  energized by that so i decided to  look up design thinking certification  programs i said i wonder if stanford  offers a certification program and i  went to stanford because they're the  best they had founded this concept in  this program so why would you not go  back to the source  i completed the creativity and design  thinking and it was one of the best  programs i've ever experienced it's  really hands-on  and we need more of that as adult  learners and because of that i feel more  confident and i can't wait to bring that  to my colleagues and i think design  thinking helps us be a bit lighter but  productive at the same time and being of  service to our students in our school  community if you want to step away from  the traditional  boring  unproductive meetings and you want to  try something that's fresh and active  you're going to want to try design  thinking  [Music]

